        "Consultation, wash, cut and style — scissor or clipper work, tailored to your hair and your week ahead.",
        "Tight, blended fade taken down to skin, finished with a sharp line-up.",
        "Cut & Beard",
        "Full haircut paired with a beard trim, shape-up and hot towel finish.",
        "Detailed beard shaping and edging with straight razor line-up and hot towel.",
        "Skin Fade + Design",
        "Skin fade with a custom hair-tattoo pattern or hard part, freehand razor work.",
        "The Full Service",
        "Signature cut, beard sculpt, hot towel and scalp massage — the whole hour."
